The common-model head layout/decoder contract derives from lochuan/lean-mici
commit 617e00670a123da12809a65796985aae05710a08. v4 framing was checked against
the installed Chipmunk 0.17-os library and real phone wire. Owner confirmed
licence authorization. Models and phone runtime binaries are not redistributed.
warp_pack.cpp and warp_pack.h are copied unchanged from the same lean-master commit.
libcamera.so is built from this plugin and the matching xpilot system encoder.

